  ],
  "duration_s": 514.043991,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了，第十五到第十一，闽越国被汉武帝迁走，百姓夜郎国留下一个成语，八国消失在崇山峻岭，滇国靠金印重新被发现，齐国靠青铜器铭文证明自己存在过。好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了。有人说曾国呢、中山国呢、西夏呢？别急，秦铜。今天这集就是第十到第六，一个比一个邪乎。最后那个史书上连一个字都没写过，全靠挖出来的东西才知道它存在过。老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁。在听第十名，曾国开个国家，史书上连一个字都没写过，左传里没有，史记里也没有嗯。直到一九七八年，湖北随州擂古墩考古队挖开了一座墓，曾侯乙木一下子惊动了全世界，出土了一套编钟，六十五件青铜编钟。两千四百多年了，还能演奏音域跨五个半八度十二个半音齐全，只比现代钢琴少一个八度。这套编钟一出土，全世界都傻了，两千四百年前的中国人是怎么做到可最让人吃惊的？还不是编钟，是墓主人的身份。曾侯乙史书上从来没有记载过叫曾国的国家，这个曾国是从哪儿冒出来的？后来，考古队又挖了叶家山郭家庙文峰塔一系列曾国墓的，至少发现了十三位曾侯。一个被史书彻底遗忘的诸侯国，靠着青铜器，硬生生把自己从地底下挖了出来。第九名中商国战国时期有一个国家在燕国和赵国之间，把这两个大国夹在中间，居然撑了一百多年。他就是中山国。中山国是白帝人见不是华夏族，所以中原诸侯看不起他，可中山国偏偏很能打跟燕赵魏齐都交过手。公元前二百九十六年，赵武灵王的铁骑灭了中山国，从此淹没于历史。中山国的目的在河北平山县考古队挖开以后，出土了大量精美文物，有错金银铜板。赵玉图是中国最早的建筑平面图，有双翼神兽造型诡异，有中山王铁足大。铜鼎明文里记载了中山国的历史，一个被赵国灭掉的国家，靠着自己的青铜器，把自己的故事讲给了两千年后的人听。第八名，大理国金庸、天龙八部里，段誉就是大大理国的王子。这不是编的历史上真有段誉叫段和誉，是大理国第十六代帝王。大理国是白族人建的，公元九百三十七年，建国定都扬阁灭城，就是今天的大理。大理国大力推行汉族文化，用汉字尊儒学、崇佛教，以儒治国，以佛治。新经济也很发达，地广人数、器械精良，农业水平跟中原差不多。可这个国家在公元一千二百五十三年被忽必烈灭了，大理国主断翅投降，被任命为世袭总管。原大理官员多受封为云南各地的土司，一个五百年的佛国，就这样融入了元朝版图，大理的壁画和木刻，现在还有遗存。昆明古状公园里的石状是大理国石雕仅存的硕果。第七名，西夏王朝公元一千零三十八年，党项人元昊称帝，建立西夏。跟北宋辽金打了两百年，西夏有自己的文字西夏文，有自己完整的典章制度，有自己的帝陵九座地顶二百多座，陪葬墓在贺兰山下排开，规模一点不比中原王朝差可。公元一千二百二十七年，成吉思汗的铁骑灭了西夏。蒙古军队占领西夏后，进行了残酷的屠戮和焚烧，城内十几万党项人全部被杀，西夏从此灰飞烟灭。元朝修史的时候，辽史有金史，有宋史有，唯独没有西夏的砖史。一个存在了近两百年的王朝，被从历史记忆里抹掉了。直到清朝学者张铎在甘肃武威发现了一块西夏文石碑，这个消失的王朝才重新回到人们的视野。上世纪俄国探险家在黑水城遗址挖出了八千多号西夏文献，跟殷墟、甲骨文、居延汉简敦煌遗书，并称二十世纪初重大考古发现，第六名，古蜀国。李白写过蚕虫及鱼廓开国何茫然，古蜀国的一历史比李白还茫然。这个国家在四川盆地存在了一千五百多年，从新石器时代晚期一直到商末周初，可他就像出现的时候一样，突然的消失了。一九八六年，三星堆两个祭祀坑被发现，上千件稀世珍宝，出土青铜神术，青铜大力人纵木面具、黄金权杖。每一件都在告诉世界，这里曾经有一个高度发达的文明，可这个文明为什么会突然消失？水患说、战争说、瘟疫说、迁都说，每一种说法都有道理，每一种说法都证据不足。最新的考古发现，三星堆和金沙遗址的年代是紧密衔接的。有学者认为，三星堆的政治中心转移到了成都金沙，可到底是迁都还是灭亡，到现在也没个定论。一个出土了这么多经世文物的文明，我们连他叫什么名字都不知道。从第十到第六，曾国靠编钟把自己挖了出来。中山国靠青铜器讲出了自己的故事，大理国融进了元朝版图，西夏被从史书里抹掉了。古蜀国连自己叫什么名字都没留下，可这五个还不是最邪乎的。接下来第五道第一，一个比一个震撼，有一座三千人的小国，留下一封求救信人没了。有一座丝绸之路上的明珠，被黄沙整个吞掉。还有一座五千年的古城，比夏朝还早。有宫殿、有水坝、有玉器，可他不在任何史书里，司马迁都不知道他存在。更有一个国家消失了，三千年史书上就留了一句话，全靠挖出来的青铜器才把他找回来。他是谁？他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 210,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 930,
      "end_ms": 1730,
      "text": "咱们盘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1730,
      "end_ms": 3150,
      "text": "第十五到第十一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3730,
      "end_ms": 6430,
      "text": "闽越国被汉武帝迁走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6490,
      "end_ms": 9610,
      "text": "百姓夜郎国留下一个成语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 10090,
      "end_ms": 12770,
      "text": "八国消失在崇山峻岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13830,
      "end_ms": 16910,
      "text": "滇国靠金印重新被发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17330,
      "end_ms": 21150,
      "text": "齐国靠青铜器铭文证明自己存在过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21910,
      "end_ms": 24030,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24030,
      "end_ms": 28170,
      "text": "有人说曾国呢、中山国呢、西夏呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28230,
      "end_ms": 28810,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28830,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "秦铜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 32920,
      "text": "今天这集就是第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33500,
      "end_ms": 35080,
      "text": "一个比一个邪乎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 35720,
      "end_ms": 39260,
      "text": "最后那个史书上连一个字都没写过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 39580,
      "end_ms": 42920,
      "text": "全靠挖出来的东西才知道它存在过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 43000,
      "end_ms": 47220,
      "text": "老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 47520,
      "end_ms": 49140,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 49140,
      "end_ms": 51480,
      "text": "在听第十名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 51600,
      "end_ms": 53860,
      "text": "曾国开个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55360,
      "end_ms": 57340,
      "text": "史书上连一个字都没写过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 57740,
      "end_ms": 58660,
      "text": "左传里没有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58900,
      "end_ms": 60260,
      "text": "史记里也没有嗯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60560,
      "end_ms": 61785,
      "text": "直到一九七八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62050,
      "end_ms": 65885,
      "text": "湖北随州擂古墩考古队挖开了一座墓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66410,
      "end_ms": 70235,
      "text": "曾侯乙木一下子惊动了全世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 70700,
      "end_ms": 72445,
      "text": "出土了一套编钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 72910,
      "end_ms": 74945,
      "text": "六十五件青铜编钟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75510,
      "end_ms": 77105,
      "text": "两千四百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 77360,
      "end_ms": 82175,
      "text": "还能演奏音域跨五个半八度十二个半音齐全，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 82550,
      "end_ms": 85055,
      "text": "只比现代钢琴少一个八度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 85740,
      "end_ms": 87320,
      "text": "这套编钟一出土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 87540,
      "end_ms": 88715,
      "text": "全世界都傻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 89370,
      "end_ms": 94560,
      "text": "两千四百年前的中国人是怎么做到可最让人吃惊的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 94560,
      "end_ms": 95435,
      "text": "还不是编钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 95740,
      "end_ms": 96945,
      "text": "是墓主人的身份。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 97980,
      "end_ms": 102125,
      "text": "曾侯乙史书上从来没有记载过叫曾国的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 102920,
      "end_ms": 104875,
      "text": "这个曾国是从哪儿冒出来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 105400,
      "end_ms": 105840,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 106020,
      "end_ms": 112795,
      "text": "考古队又挖了叶家山郭家庙文峰塔一系列曾国墓的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113090,
      "end_ms": 115845,
      "text": "至少发现了十三位曾侯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116760,
      "end_ms": 119380,
      "text": "一个被史书彻底遗忘的诸侯国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 119560,
      "end_ms": 120705,
      "text": "靠着青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 121470,
      "end_ms": 124605,
      "text": "硬生生把自己从地底下挖了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 125750,
      "end_ms": 134375,
      "text": "第九名中商国战国时期有一个国家在燕国和赵国之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 135810,
      "end_ms": 138185,
      "text": "把这两个大国夹在中间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138840,
      "end_ms": 140325,
      "text": "居然撑了一百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 141170,
      "end_ms": 142255,
      "text": "他就是中山国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 143120,
      "end_ms": 147085,
      "text": "中山国是白帝人见不是华夏族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 147930,
      "end_ms": 149925,
      "text": "所以中原诸侯看不起他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 150890,
      "end_ms": 156575,
      "text": "可中山国偏偏很能打跟燕赵魏齐都交过手。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 157350,
      "end_ms": 158865,
      "text": "公元前二百九十六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 159510,
      "end_ms": 162340,
      "text": "赵武灵王的铁骑灭了中山国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 162720,
      "end_ms": 164995,
      "text": "从此淹没于历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 165250,
      "end_ms": 170925,
      "text": "中山国的目的在河北平山县考古队挖开以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 171290,
      "end_ms": 173225,
      "text": "出土了大量精美文物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 173850,
      "end_ms": 175710,
      "text": "有错金银铜板。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 175830,
      "end_ms": 179375,
      "text": "赵玉图是中国最早的建筑平面图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 179980,
      "end_ms": 183620,
      "text": "有双翼神兽造型诡异，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 184200,
      "end_ms": 186160,
      "text": "有中山王铁足大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 186160,
      "end_ms": 190620,
      "text": "铜鼎明文里记载了中山国的历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 191420,
      "end_ms": 193500,
      "text": "一个被赵国灭掉的国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 194400,
      "end_ms": 196060,
      "text": "靠着自己的青铜器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 196560,
      "end_ms": 200060,
      "text": "把自己的故事讲给了两千年后的人听。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 201140,
      "end_ms": 201800,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 202800,
      "end_ms": 206720,
      "text": "大理国金庸、天龙八部里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 207960,
      "end_ms": 210810,
      "text": "段誉就是大大理国的王子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 210930,
      "end_ms": 215370,
      "text": "这不是编的历史上真有段誉叫段和誉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 215650,
      "end_ms": 218110,
      "text": "是大理国第十六代帝王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 218470,
      "end_ms": 220270,
      "text": "大理国是白族人建的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 220830,
      "end_ms": 222490,
      "text": "公元九百三十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 222530,
      "end_ms": 225290,
      "text": "建国定都扬阁灭城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 225890,
      "end_ms": 227270,
      "text": "就是今天的大理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 227730,
      "end_ms": 230270,
      "text": "大理国大力推行汉族文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 230570,
      "end_ms": 233730,
      "text": "用汉字尊儒学、崇佛教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 234110,
      "end_ms": 235230,
      "text": "以儒治国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 235510,
      "end_ms": 236310,
      "text": "以佛治。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 236310,
      "end_ms": 238470,
      "text": "新经济也很发达，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 238670,
      "end_ms": 240905,
      "text": "地广人数、器械精良，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 241550,
      "end_ms": 243655,
      "text": "农业水平跟中原差不多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 244070,
      "end_ms": 248305,
      "text": "可这个国家在公元一千二百五十三年被忽必烈灭了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 248500,
      "end_ms": 250335,
      "text": "大理国主断翅投降，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 250830,
      "end_ms": 252855,
      "text": "被任命为世袭总管。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 253490,
      "end_ms": 256675,
      "text": "原大理官员多受封为云南各地的土司，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 257160,
      "end_ms": 258745,
      "text": "一个五百年的佛国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 259090,
      "end_ms": 261335,
      "text": "就这样融入了元朝版图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 262000,
      "end_ms": 263960,
      "text": "大理的壁画和木刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 264200,
      "end_ms": 265345,
      "text": "现在还有遗存。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 265860,
      "end_ms": 270835,
      "text": "昆明古状公园里的石状是大理国石雕仅存的硕果。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 272110,
      "end_ms": 272715,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 273030,
      "end_ms": 275975,
      "text": "西夏王朝公元一千零三十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 276420,
      "end_ms": 278085,
      "text": "党项人元昊称帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 278610,
      "end_ms": 279575,
      "text": "建立西夏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 279840,
      "end_ms": 282925,
      "text": "跟北宋辽金打了两百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 283380,
      "end_ms": 285765,
      "text": "西夏有自己的文字西夏文，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 286100,
      "end_ms": 288440,
      "text": "有自己完整的典章制度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 288640,
      "end_ms": 292400,
      "text": "有自己的帝陵九座地顶二百多座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 292400,
      "end_ms": 294925,
      "text": "陪葬墓在贺兰山下排开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 295730,
      "end_ms": 299240,
      "text": "规模一点不比中原王朝差可。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 299240,
      "end_ms": 301045,
      "text": "公元一千二百二十七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 301830,
      "end_ms": 304215,
      "text": "成吉思汗的铁骑灭了西夏。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 305130,
      "end_ms": 306970,
      "text": "蒙古军队占领西夏后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 307170,
      "end_ms": 309970,
      "text": "进行了残酷的屠戮和焚烧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 310750,
      "end_ms": 313430,
      "text": "城内十几万党项人全部被杀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 313890,
      "end_ms": 316550,
      "text": "西夏从此灰飞烟灭。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 317510,
      "end_ms": 318950,
      "text": "元朝修史的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 319330,
      "end_ms": 320850,
      "text": "辽史有金史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 320850,
      "end_ms": 322050,
      "text": "有宋史有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 322410,
      "end_ms": 324450,
      "text": "唯独没有西夏的砖史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 324690,
      "end_ms": 327370,
      "text": "一个存在了近两百年的王朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 327850,
      "end_ms": 330070,
      "text": "被从历史记忆里抹掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 330710,
      "end_ms": 337040,
      "text": "直到清朝学者张铎在甘肃武威发现了一块西夏文石碑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 337860,
      "end_ms": 341720,
      "text": "这个消失的王朝才重新回到人们的视野。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 342140,
      "end_ms": 348420,
      "text": "上世纪俄国探险家在黑水城遗址挖出了八千多号西夏文献，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 348860,
      "end_ms": 353260,
      "text": "跟殷墟、甲骨文、居延汉简敦煌遗书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 353300,
      "end_ms": 356300,
      "text": "并称二十世纪初重大考古发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 356860,
      "end_ms": 357560,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 357960,
      "end_ms": 358760,
      "text": "古蜀国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 359320,
      "end_ms": 363980,
      "text": "李白写过蚕虫及鱼廓开国何茫然，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 364140,
      "end_ms": 367125,
      "text": "古蜀国的一历史比李白还茫然。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 368090,
      "end_ms": 371335,
      "text": "这个国家在四川盆地存在了一千五百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 371960,
      "end_ms": 375565,
      "text": "从新石器时代晚期一直到商末周初，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 376370,
      "end_ms": 378245,
      "text": "可他就像出现的时候一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 378730,
      "end_ms": 379870,
      "text": "突然的消失了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 379890,
      "end_ms": 380845,
      "text": "一九八六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 381170,
      "end_ms": 383895,
      "text": "三星堆两个祭祀坑被发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 384790,
      "end_ms": 386550,
      "text": "上千件稀世珍宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 386550,
      "end_ms": 389045,
      "text": "出土青铜神术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 389760,
      "end_ms": 393825,
      "text": "青铜大力人纵木面具、黄金权杖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 394280,
      "end_ms": 396335,
      "text": "每一件都在告诉世界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 397280,
      "end_ms": 399935,
      "text": "这里曾经有一个高度发达的文明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 400540,
      "end_ms": 403115,
      "text": "可这个文明为什么会突然消失？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 403390,
      "end_ms": 407405,
      "text": "水患说、战争说、瘟疫说、迁都说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 407770,
      "end_ms": 409605,
      "text": "每一种说法都有道理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 410050,
      "end_ms": 412115,
      "text": "每一种说法都证据不足。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 412970,
      "end_ms": 414530,
      "text": "最新的考古发现，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 414810,
      "end_ms": 419165,
      "text": "三星堆和金沙遗址的年代是紧密衔接的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 419780,
      "end_ms": 420780,
      "text": "有学者认为，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 421020,
      "end_ms": 425125,
      "text": "三星堆的政治中心转移到了成都金沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 425870,
      "end_ms": 428215,
      "text": "可到底是迁都还是灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 428590,
      "end_ms": 430545,
      "text": "到现在也没个定论。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 431090,
      "end_ms": 433955,
      "text": "一个出土了这么多经世文物的文明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 434520,
      "end_ms": 436765,
      "text": "我们连他叫什么名字都不知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 437270,
      "end_ms": 439185,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 440210,
      "end_ms": 442855,
      "text": "曾国靠编钟把自己挖了出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 443030,
      "end_ms": 446555,
      "text": "中山国靠青铜器讲出了自己的故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 447460,
      "end_ms": 450125,
      "text": "大理国融进了元朝版图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 450960,
      "end_ms": 453035,
      "text": "西夏被从史书里抹掉了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 453820,
      "end_ms": 457125,
      "text": "古蜀国连自己叫什么名字都没留下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 457670,
      "end_ms": 461435,
      "text": "可这五个还不是最邪乎的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 461760,
      "end_ms": 463625,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 464620,
      "end_ms": 466305,
      "text": "一个比一个震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 467340,
      "end_ms": 469645,
      "text": "有一座三千人的小国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 470150,
      "end_ms": 473935,
      "text": "留下一封求救信人没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 474230,
      "end_ms": 476825,
      "text": "有一座丝绸之路上的明珠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 477380,
      "end_ms": 479315,
      "text": "被黄沙整个吞掉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 479770,
      "end_ms": 481915,
      "text": "还有一座五千年的古城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 482530,
      "end_ms": 483685,
      "text": "比夏朝还早。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 484030,
      "end_ms": 487005,
      "text": "有宫殿、有水坝、有玉器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 488090,
      "end_ms": 490045,
      "text": "可他不在任何史书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 490900,
      "end_ms": 492785,
      "text": "司马迁都不知道他存在。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 493780,
      "end_ms": 495940,
      "text": "更有一个国家消失了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 495940,
      "end_ms": 499355,
      "text": "三千年史书上就留了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 500230,
      "end_ms": 504045,
      "text": "全靠挖出来的青铜器才把他找回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 504610,
      "end_ms": 505285,
      "text": "他是谁？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 505620,
      "end_ms": 508565,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0be6e344334f9dd4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 508950,
      "end_ms": 512535,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
